{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1060879/block/singleImage/3251752/wm/01KR2YJMWBFAA9NNJJ90QSASAD.jpeg?updatedAt=1793240552\"/><figcaption>大埔中年漢街頭捱斬腳傷送院，4兇徒落網。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>昨日 (28 日 ) 下午 5 時 05 分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指與丈夫步行至大埔北盛街一店鋪外時，突然有 4 名男子從私家車下車，其中兩人懷疑各以一把約 1 尺長的刀襲擊丈夫， 4 男其後登上私家車逃去。 人員接報到場，該名 41 歲姓李男子腳部受傷，清醒被送往雅麗氏何妙齡那打素醫院治理。經進一步調查，人員今日 (29 日 ) 上午於大埔區以涉嫌「傷人」拘捕 4 名本地男子，年齡介乎 40 至 50 歲，所有被捕人現正被扣留調查</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.535134+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:22:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:10.769072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:25.035549+00:00","content_hash":"08dbe24b22fe8bf4887c2c05448d0aa4328a2351a06e5667da316eea1de1c959","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.535134+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}